    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Create and manage webrings on your WordPress site with a dedicated<br />\ncustom post type for member websites. You can optionally organize<br />\nentries with categories to keep your webrings structured and easy<br />\nto maintain.</p>\n<p>The plugin also provides a block for displaying the HTML snippet<br />\nvisitors can use to join or link to your webrings, plus a block<br />\nthat lists all websites currently included in a webring.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First stable version</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Create and manage webrings on your WordPress site.",
    "description": "<p>Create and manage webrings on your WordPress site with a dedicated<br />\ncustom post type for member websites. You can optionally organize<br />\nentries with categories to keep your webrings structured and easy<br />\nto maintain.</p>\n<p>The plugin also provides a block for displaying the HTML snippet<br />\nvisitors can use to join or link to your webrings, plus a block<br />\nthat lists all websites currently included in a webring.</p>\n",
